      exampleText: 'Opening this page mid-crossing is safe by construction: the sweep freezes mid-arc, the clock holds, and Paranoia accrues nothing while you read. Pressing F1 again does nothing — closing a reading surface is a deliberate act, not a key bounce. Escape first closes the drawer if it is open, then clears an active search, then closes the archive.',
