      recoveryTitle: 'Focus, pause, and teardown safety',
      recoveryText: 'Opening is idempotent and closing is symmetric: each surface releases exactly the pause it acquired, no matter how it closes — control, Escape, unmount, or a New Game underneath it. If the menu already paused the world, the archive rides along and closing it leaves the menu’s pause intact.',
