      feedbackText: 'Color never acts alone: every danger, focus, or restriction pairs its hue with shape, text, or sound. The protagonist stays in the lower-center lead during normal play, and the things that matter — doors, devices, people — survive every supported viewport.',
      recoveryTitle: 'Visual correctness is gameplay correctness',
