      feedbackText: 'One-shot cues cannot be replayed by interface churn. Search and section changes announce politely to assistive tech. Tables carry captions and headers. Focus loops are contained. Long Ukrainian strings get room instead of truncation.',
      recoveryTitle: 'Graceful degradation',
